  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 85d3a3c132045064f90bce2b442406f4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  dialogueLines:
  - breaking news the warload is coming oh shit!!!! oh my goodness gracious the warlord
    is coming to town to kill us all this is so bad!!
  - 'weather update: 100% chance of acid rain. stay in doors! unless you want your
    face 2 melt off'
  - 'breaking news the economy is still in shambles and inflation is very high!!!! '
  - breaking news our glorious leader just posted an ai image of himself with big
    muscles and lots of money this is not actually breaking news or noteworthy in
    anyway this happens all the time here in spoiltopia.
  - massive inequality between spoiled and non spoiled citizens! survey results say
    50% of mothers would not let their children date a spoiled citizen.
  - spoilistan is at war with spoilsberg over territorial disputes in the spoilsville
    mountain range
  - rates of spoiled children rising dramatically. not like children with rich parents
    like you know like their bodies are rotting. Sad!
  timeBetweenLines: 5
